  "discussion": "A centralised event logging facility can be used to capture, protect and manage event logs from multiple sources in a coordinated manner. This may be achieved by using a security information and event management (SIEM) platform, a security orchestration, automation and response (SOAR) platform, or both. Furthermore, in support of a centralised event logging facility, it is important that an accurate and consistent time source is used to assist with identifying connections between events.",
